However, since we need a single assert statement, we can combine these conditions using a logical OR:

<code>assert item == null ? this.get(this.size() - 1) == null : this.get(this.size() - 1).equals(item);</code>

Or more cleanly using the ternary operator:

<code>assert this.get(this.size() - 1) == (item == null ? null : item);</code>

So the final answer is:

