However, since we need a single assert statement, we can combine the conditions:

<code>assert (item == null) == (this.get(this.size() - 1) == null);</code>

Or more precisely reflecting the given condition:

<code>assert item == this.get(this.size() - 1);</code>

This single assert statement captures the essence of the comment by ensuring that the last item in the stack is equal to the pushed item, whether it is null or not.

